ff.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/004-40bb6aaeff.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/005-ba9cc778d8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/005-ba9cc778d8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/006-0ce8b56ff6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/006-0ce8b56ff6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/007-15ddfa04da.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/007-15ddfa04da.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/008-745eefa70b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/008-745eefa70b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/009-f2aa177b4e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/009-f2aa177b4e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/010-a81415135a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/010-a81415135a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/011-2d957d2830.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/011-2d957d2830.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/012-617e95b89c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/012-617e95b89c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n仙台正值青叶祭\n热闹得不得了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n在这样的情况下\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n有将近350位朋友\n\n前来参加\n\n我真的非常开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n大家真的谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    这次的20周年签名会\n和大家\n面对面\n聊了很多\n度过了一段美好时光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n没抽中签的大家\n\n以及在签名会期间前来找我的大家\n谢谢你们！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有信件和礼物\n\n也谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/013-fd256f6729.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/013-fd256f6729.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦中心东北\n\n<br>\n\n\n我还会再来的\n请多关照！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！","markdown_ja":"<br>\n本日\n\nマスダのサイン会が行われました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/001-2028a2baf4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/001-2028a2baf4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"848\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n控室のかぶりものコダック！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nコダック売りのお姉さん！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/002-e16bc70b37.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/002-e16bc70b37.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"778\" height=\"940\"></a></figure>\n\n \n\nマスダが持ってるのは\n\nみがわりのコダック！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいろんなコダックがいる（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまずは\nサイン会に来てくれたみんなと\n\n抽選前の記念撮影！\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/003-43ce1361ce.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/003-43ce1361ce.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/004-40bb6aaeff.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/004-40bb6aaeff.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/005-ba9cc778d8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/005-ba9cc778d8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/006-0ce8b56ff6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/006-0ce8b56ff6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/007-15ddfa04da.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/007-15ddfa04da.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/008-745eefa70b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3476333/008-745eefa70b.webp\" alt=\"\" loadin